OL,3,AApple's new boss starts with big gamble
OL,4,Aon #1,999 first folding iPhone
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple has launched its most expensive
OL,7,FiPhone ever - a foldable handheld that
OL,8,Fcosts at least #1,999 and marks the
OL,9,Ffirst major iPhone design change in
OL,10,Falmost 20 years.
OL,12,FThe iPhone Duo is a gamble by new boss
OL,13,FJohn Ternus, who took over from
OL,14,Flong-time chief executive Tim Cook this
OL,15,Fmonth.
OL,17,FApple is entering the foldable phone
OL,18,Fmarket comparatively late, following
OL,19,Fthe likes of South Korea's Samsung and
OL,20,FChina's Huawei.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,117,105,200,300,0,100
