OL,3,AApple's new boss starts with big gamble
OL,4,Aon #1,999 first folding iPhone
OL,5,
OL,6,FTernus told an audience at Apple's
OL,7,FCalifornia headquarters: "Others have
OL,8,Fcreated foldables that just feel like
OL,9,Ftwo phones awkwardly stuck together".
OL,10,FApple's model, he claimed "redefine[s]
OL,11,Fthe experience of using a foldable
OL,12,Fphone".
